name xebaposter
category Package
revision 63513
shortdesc Create beautiful scientific Persian/Latin posters using TikZ
longdesc This package is designed for making beautiful scientific
longdesc Persian/Latin posters. It is a fork of baposter by Brian Amberg
longdesc and Reinhold Kainhofer available at
longdesc http://www.brian-amberg.de/uni/poster/. baposter's users should
longdesc be able to compile their poster using xebaposter (instead of
longdesc baposter) without any problem.
